OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy and
OL,6,Fdry for most of the night. Clear
OL,7,Fspells develop in places by the early
OL,8,Fhours of Thursday morning, allowing
OL,9,Fmist or fog to form in prone
OL,10,Flocations. A light breeze throughout.
OL,11,FRemaining milder in urban areas.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FAny morning fog will slowly
OL,14,Fclear to give way to some sunny spells
OL,15,Fin the afternoon. The wind remains
OL,16,Flight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
