OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FSettled
OL,6,Fand dry in the coming days. Light
OL,7,Fwinds allow fog to form overnight,
OL,8,Fwidespread at times, slowly burning
OL,9,Faway to give prolonged sunny spells by
OL,10,Fthe afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
